				"A pair of hands wearing minimalist black gloves, captured in a realistic close-up: a knife swiftly slices a crystal glass-like fruit on a wooden cutting board. The blade cuts repeatedly, and with each slice, the glass-like fruit segment topples over as the knife moves to the next spot. The interior of this 'fruit' is also glass-like. The audio adopts an ASMR style."
